Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我意思是 你是什么 - 我是侍奉主的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean what are you? - I'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些复活的长老是66封印之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rising of the witnesses is one of the 66 seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些封印被莉莉丝给破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those seals are being broken by lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一道封印被解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last one opens and…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法就自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer walks free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开始用你的超能力了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, you been using your, uh, freaky e.s.p. stuff? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就让它顺其自然吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, let's keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是把恶魔从躯体中赶出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just exorcising demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把他们送回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can send them back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但请从另一个角度看看 - 另一角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But try to see the other side here. - The other side?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把恶魔从无辜人群中驱除出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pulling demons out of innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.13,0:00:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以用刀啊 - 用刀会杀了受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Use the knife! - The knife kills the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我能让他们存活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do, most of them survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该对我放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should show me some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能拉你出地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dragged you out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,大可以把你扔回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can throw you back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.86,0:01:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,商店情况怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was the store?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一片狂乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.33,0:01:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇上所有人都在采购\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in town was stocking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.80,0:01:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,该买的都买了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did, uh, you get enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了这些我可和诺玛·布莱克推搡了好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to arm-wrestle norma bleaker for these.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 她可74岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, she's 74.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可比看上去健壮的多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a lot stronger than she looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得去年吗 我们6点30就吃完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember last year? we ran out at 6:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一颗 喂喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just one piece. unh-unh-unh-unh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在万圣节后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have as much as you want…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃多少就吃多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}After halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.70,0:01:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊谁该洗洗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, who needs a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去洗澡喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一分钟后上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, uh, I'll be up in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克 怎么这么久啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, what's taking you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第4季第7集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到了多少刀片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how many razor blades did they find?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,两片在地上 一片在他胃里 还有片卡在他喉咙里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two on the floor, one in his stomach, and one was stuck in his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吞了四片下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He swallowed four of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖果可不会跑到烤箱里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The candy was never in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都得检查 华莱士夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to be thorough, mrs. wallace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察在其余糖果里有发现刀片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the police find any razors in the rest of the candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我不知道 我不这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, i don't know. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法相信这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在都市传说上看过这事 但这真有其事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear urban legends about this stuff, but it actually happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,超乎你的想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than you might imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,华莱士夫人 卢克有什么仇家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. wallace, did luke have any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,仇家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.60,0:04:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他有过恨意的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone who might have held a grudge against him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Co-workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在暗示婚外情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you suggesting an affair?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 卢克绝不会 - 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, luke would nev… - I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不得不考虑所有的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to consider all possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人想杀了我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}If someone wanted to kill my husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会想出比在一颗他可能吃的糖果里放刀片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think they'd find a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,更行得通的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than a razor in a piece of candy he might eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙可吞下所有刀片哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that guy choked down all those razor blades?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,万圣节呢 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's halloween, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.53,0:05:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我们而言 每天都是万圣节\N{\fnArial\fs30}For us, every day is halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.53,0:05:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装的那么镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a downer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次是搜查巫婆 这点可以肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're on a witch-hunt, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不是你典型的魔法袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this isn't your typical hex bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. no?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄连 已经绝种200年的草药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldthread … an herb that's been extinct for 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是凯尔特货币 我不是说那些仿造币\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is celtic, and I don't mean some new age knock-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去那么的精致 像600年前那么真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the real deal … like 600-years-old real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是新生儿的烧焦的掌骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the charred metacarpal bone of a newborn baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.26,0:05:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看起来至少有100年历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, like, at least 100 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这么弄可以让魔咒的效果更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right, like that makes it better?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫婆 伙计 他们真是怪异变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witches, man. they're so freaking skeevy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.43,0:05:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄个袋子把这些放一块产生的魔力很大吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it takes a pretty powerful one to put a bag like this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定比以前碰到的要厉害的多 这点可以肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}More juice than we've ever dealt with before, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 在受害者身上有找到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you … find anything on the victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克·华莱士 非常平凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}This luke wallace … he was so vanilla that he made vanilla seem spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为何有人会想要他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find any reason why somebody would want this guy dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是聚会挑逗哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This party blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去钓个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should just go t.p. somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 贾斯汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hey, justin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闯进酒吧了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break into the booze yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,上了三把锁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's triple-locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们明晚会去陵墓晚会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you guys going to the mausoleum party tomorrow night?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定很激动人心 我都等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be rad. I'm gonna get so baked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定比这逊毙了的节日强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's got to be better than this g-rated assfest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.93,0:06:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 也没这么逊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, it's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们来验证下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 敲打苹果会残废哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, bobbing for apples is lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.46,0:06:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 这可是万圣节啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, it's halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,残废\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand corrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.43,0:07:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我也想试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i want to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还真能憋气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can really hold her breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:07:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.03,0:08:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny! what is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.73,0:08:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! jenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个妞我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,俩字 祸水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two words … jail bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 这实在是怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's just so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,浴盆里的水 绝不可能是热的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the water in the tub … it wasn't hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己也刚体验过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had just been in there myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友认不认识一个叫卢克·华莱士的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You friend didn't happen to know a man named luke wallace?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,FBI探员西格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent seger … fbi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是卢克·华莱士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, who's luke wallace?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.03,0:09:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他昨天死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 两个受害者都没有前科\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, both of these vics are squeaky-clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没任何理由被这么卑鄙的杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no reason for wicked-bitch payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许事情并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe 'cause it's not about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有见解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. insightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许女巫并非恨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this witch isn't working a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是某种诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're working a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在超过三天内有超过三个血祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}"three blood sacrifices over three days … the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在收获的最后一天的午夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before midnight on the final day of the final harvest."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据凯尔特人的日历\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celtic calendar…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,收获的最后一天是在10月31号\N{\fnArial\fs30}the final day of the final harvest is october 31st.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 万圣节 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Halloween? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是血祭的真正目的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are the, uh, blood sacrifices for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没猜错 这个巫婆在召集恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if I'm right, this witch is summoning a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有不单单是小鬼 还有死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not just any demon … samhain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该对他有印象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I supposed to be impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 死神是来源于万圣节的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, samhain is the damn origin of halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些凯尔特人相信在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The celts believed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,10月31日是一年之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}october 31st was the one night of the.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在生与死之间的隔膜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Year when the veil was thinnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.06,0:10:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最脆弱的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}between the living and the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这就是死神之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was samhain's night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们带上面具去躲避死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, masks were put on to hide from him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在楼梯上的糖果是来安抚死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweets left on doorsteps to appease him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,刻在南瓜上的脸谱是为了对死神表示崇拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faces carved into pumpkins to worship him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在几个世纪之前就被驱逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was exorcised centuries ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以死神回了一趟地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So even though samhain took a trip downstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个传统就这样形成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the tradition stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是现在 没有了恶魔和厮杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only now, instead of demons and blood orgies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.01,0:10:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,万圣节已经成了小孩子的节日\N{\fnArial\fs30}, halloween is all about kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖果和戏服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy, and costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以有哪个巫婆想召集死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so some witch wants to raise samhain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,和让那一晚重演吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take back the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这不是闹着玩的 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this is serious. I am serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在对抗的是重量级的女魔头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking heavyweight witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的仪式只能在600年举办一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ritual can only be performed every 600 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在600年前这样的事情是发生在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the 600-year marker rolls around…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天晚上 通常是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow night. naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以确定就因为一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it sure is a lot of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有很多人死和毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}death and destruction for one demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西就像一个组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 'cause he likes company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.30,0:10:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他被唤醒了 死神就可以自己唤醒自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once he's raised, samhain can do some raising of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,唤醒什么 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raising what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗 邪恶之灵还有很多这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark, evil crap and lots of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.33,0:10:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会跟着他就像吹笛手一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They follow him around like the friggin' pied piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们是在说鬼魂吧 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're talking ghosts. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zombies? mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妖精 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leprechauns? dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:10:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些小鬼头很胆小 手小小的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those little dudes are scary. small hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这个仪式是开始与鬼魂和食尸鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it just starts with ghosts and ghouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会一直都很胆小 可是一旦夜晚结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sucker keeps on going, by night's end,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会变成我们见过的最恐怖的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are talking every awful thing we've ever seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有我们要干掉的东西都集中在一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we fight all in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将回成为屠杀场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a slaughterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我又是再说剃刀小姐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, i talked with mrs. razor blade again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经在她家门前干坐了几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been sitting out in front of her house for hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.61,0:11:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一堆雾之外 我啥也看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've got a big, steamy pile of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 迪恩 有人在在对那个妖术袋子心怀不轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dean, someone planted those hex bags,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人会进入那两间房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone with access to both houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这之间一定有什么联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be some connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能快点找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we find him soon 'cause I'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我己经像一个兔崽子一样在抽筋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting to cramp like a … son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别抱怨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我是说“兔崽子”\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sam, I mean "son of a bitch."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那个咬苹果的啦啦队队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our apple-bobbing cheerleader?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy? mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是华莱士家的保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wallaces' babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟我说她从来没有听说过卢克 华莱士\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me she'd never even heard of luke wallace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一个上百岁的女巫婆来说是一个不错的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting look for a centuries-old witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你都600岁了然后想打扮一下回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were a 600-year-old hag and you could pick any.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不会伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Costume to come back in,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,成啦啦队队长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't you go for a hot cheerleader?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 崔西并不像她看起来那么健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tracy's not as wholesome as she looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,查了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did some digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然她跟她其中一个老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, she got into a violent altercation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.65,0:12:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生过很严重的争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one of her teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,被逐出了学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got suspended from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.98,0:13:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起些什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring back memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在青春期的时候 充满着焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a teenager, all that angst.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you think I meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就唤起我一些记忆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我要一个更大的窑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, i need a bigger kiln.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.88,0:13:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位先生想跟我聊聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gentlemen wanted to talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈丁先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, mr. harding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我唐就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. don.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, don.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连我的学生也叫我唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even my students call me don.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们懂了 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we get it, don.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.95,0:13:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是盖迪特工 他是李特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, i'm agent geddy. this is agent lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想问问关于崔西 戴维斯的一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just had a few questions about, uh, tracy davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 崔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个聪明的孩子 很有天分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, bright kid, loads of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被赶出校真是可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shame she got suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们曾经发生过激烈的争吵是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two had a, uh, violent altercation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.78,0:13:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她都发狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果当时莫罗校长不是刚好经过的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if principal murrow hadn't walked by when he did,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:13:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西可能就已经把我的眼睛挖出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy would have clawed my eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:13:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想评论一下她的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, i was only trying to rap with her about her work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就反应过度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had gotten inappropriate and disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,比那些家伙的反应更过度吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}More disturbing than … than, uh, those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在每一页纸上都画上满满的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would cover page after page.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪诡异的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}with these bizarre cryptic symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些画\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there were the drawings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.41,0:14:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对厮杀 血淋淋的场景的细节描绘\N{\fnArial\fs30}… detailed images of killings, gory,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她的原创\N{\fnArial\fs30}primitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会把她自己也画在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would depict herself in the middle of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是身临其境\N{\fnArial\fs30}participating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,标志 什么标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Symbols? what kind of symbols?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是类似这样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, anything like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.45,0:14:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 我想这就是其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. yeah, i think that might have been one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道崔西现在在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where tracy is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.32,0:14:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许在她的公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would imagine her apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.65,0:14:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她的公寓 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her apartment? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 她搬到那里一个人已经住了差不多一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got here about a year ago alone, as I understood it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是刚放出来的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As an emancipated teen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道她的父母是怎样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God only knows what her parents were like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:14:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪都找不到崔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy was nowhere I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她朋友能问出些什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck with her friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天踩不到狗屎运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck is not our style.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的朋友也不知道她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends don't know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一个骑着扫帚的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the bitch hopped a broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以在任何时间进行她的第三次血祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be making the third sacrifice any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 谢啦 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不给糖我就捣蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick or treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是一个汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.75,0:15:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就没有糖果啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we don't have any candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我们有很多在…现在没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we have a ton in the, uh … we did, but it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉咯 小弟弟 我们帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kid, we can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你吃的已经够多的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i think you've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.95,0:15:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, sam, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's castiel…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他我就不认识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him, i don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.15,0:15:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 对不起 我不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, uh, i didn't mean to … sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,发自内心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 久仰大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, i-i've heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And i, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆.温切斯特 流着恶魔血液的那个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam winchester … the boy with the demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴得知你已经不再练习用意志驱魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to hear you've ceased your extracurricular activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就保持这样子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊 哥儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, chuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆海茵复活 … 你阻止它了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This raising of samhain … have you stopped it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 迪恩 你搞清女巫的位置没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? dean, have you located the witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we've located the witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is the witch dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 不过 … 我们知道她是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but … we know who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 女巫也知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, the witch knows who you are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.05,0:16:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿以前在你屋子的墙里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was inside the wall of your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们没有发现 你们俩都得完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we hadn't found it, surely one or both of you would be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道女巫现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where the witch is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在查\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,点儿太背了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你关心什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆海茵的复活是66个印记之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}The raising of samhain is one of the 66 seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:17:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这和咱们的哥们路西法有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is about your buddy lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法和咱不是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is no friend of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这么一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just an expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西佛不能复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer cannot rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须不惜一切代价阻止印记被破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The breaking of the seal must be prevented at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在这里 为什么不告诉我们女巫在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that you're here, why don't you tell us where the witch is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会干掉她 然后大家各回各家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll gank her, and everybody goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是万事通 这女巫很厉害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not omniscient. this witch is very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她擅长伪装 特别对我们这些人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cloaked, even to our methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们已知道她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, we already know who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.05,0:17:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以我们合作的话 - 就谈到这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, if we work together… - Enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算老几 我干嘛听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, and why should I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是尤瑞尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以叫他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's what you might call…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of a specialist?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们…你们俩马上给我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… both of you, you need to leave this town immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们要摧毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're about to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫必须要死 封印必须要保证完好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This witch has to die. the seal must be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有上千人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a thousand people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,1214人\N{\fnArial\fs30}1, 214.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备连他们一起干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're willing to kill them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我第一次做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the first time I've…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,净化一个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purified a city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 我理解这么做很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, i understand this is regrettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regrettable?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.30,0:18:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to hold the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多封印被破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many seals have broken already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就因为你们把封印搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you screwed the pooch on some seals,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个城市就要付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now this town has to pay the price?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是选择一千人或者六十亿人的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the lives of 1, 000 against the lives of 6 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还有更大的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bigger picture here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.13,0:18:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 你们这些人前途无量\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, uh, you're bigger-picture kind of guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法不能复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer cannot rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法如果复活 地狱将被他主宰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does, and hell rises with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们要冒险的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that something that you're willing to risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在女巫召唤任何妖怪之前组织她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll stop this witch before she summons anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的印记不会破坏 谁都不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your seal won't be broken, and no one has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在和这些鸟人浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're wasting time with these mud monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:18:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们有命令在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have our orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:19:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能这么做 你们是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't do this. you … you're angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你们不希望 你们一点怜悯心都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, aren't you supposed to … you're supposed to show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.63,0:19:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你们从没有质疑过命令对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on, what, you've never … never questioned a crap order, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩难道是铁石心肠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you both, just a couple of hammers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.70,0:19:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 就算你不明白 也应该相信这个计划是正义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, even if you can't understand it, have faith the plan is just.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你咋这么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you even say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它来自天堂 是正义的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it comes from heaven. that makes it just.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这么肯定 挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be nice to be so sure of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲给你命令 你们都不是在照做么\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your father gave you an order, didn't you obey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉孩子们 计划变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, boys, it looks like the plans have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你能阻止我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can stop us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你们要毁了这个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're gonna smite this whole town…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把我们一起毁了吧 因为我们不会走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're gonna have to smite us with it because we are not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.93,0:19:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不要把自己搅入麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went to the trouble of busting me out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我对天堂的那些家伙是有价值的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure I'm worth something to the man upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要牺牲我么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to waste me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.73,0:20:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个鸟人搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how he digs that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会靠自己把你拖出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will drag you out of here myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,成啊 但你得先杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you'll have to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就回到老问题上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're back to the same problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就为了一个女巫把全城都毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wipe out a whole town for one little witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像我要赔偿你什么似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds to me like you're compensating for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find that witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止邪恶的召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will stop the summoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 我不会让这些 … 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, I will not let these … enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作最好快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you move quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronaut!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.63,0:21:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他们与众不同呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they'd be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 天使们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, the angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着给你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i tried to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.93,0:21:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚 … 我以为他们是正义的一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just … I mean, i thought they'd be righteous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they are righteous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's kind of the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比人脑子发热去执行神圣任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing more dangerous than some.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.01,0:21:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,更危险的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-hole who thinks he's on a holy mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我认为 这是上帝还是天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, i mean, this is god and heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我一直祈祷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I've been praying to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解你相信上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're into the whole god thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.55,0:21:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有基督的那些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And jesus on a tortilla and stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.13,0:21:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just because there's a couple of bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,以偏概全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apples doesn't mean the whole barrel is rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:22:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 上帝不喜欢这些坏人 我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, for all we know, god hates these jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要放弃我提到的这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give up on the stuff is all I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝露丝是个骗子 棒球游戏还得继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe ruth was a dick, but baseball's still a beautiful game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你准备好找到女巫了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, are you gonna figure out a way to find this witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者坐在这里守着老骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you just gonna sit there fingering your bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么温度才能把骨骼烧焦 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how much heat it would take to char a bone like this, dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.63,0:22:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.86,0:22:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比厨房烤箱温度高 起码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, more than a fire or some kitchen oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 贝蒂妙厨 啥意思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, betty crocker, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means we make a stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.53,0:22:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 崔西用窑来烧骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tracy used a kiln to char the bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么大人物这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 魔法袋是在我们和崔西说话后出现在房间里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, that hex bag turned up in our room not after we talked to tracy…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那个老师说话完之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we talked to the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我滴神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are all from children.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他不是为了狗去救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing he's not saving them for the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该做决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The decision's been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.13,0:23:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那俩鸟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}By a mud monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.40,0:23:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么喊他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't call them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.53,0:23:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是这玩意 会走路的野人而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's what they are … savages, just plumbing on two legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.93,0:23:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快成老怨妇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're close to blasphemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.03,0:23:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被派来救他是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason we were sent to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.83,0:23:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有潜力获得成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has potential. he may succeed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.13,0:23:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}At any rate…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.46,0:23:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们可以控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out of our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.73,0:23:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.50,0:23:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.93,0:24:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把迪恩 温彻斯特扔在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we drag dean winchester out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.15,0:24:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们把这些无关紧要的针从地图上拔下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we blow this insignificant pinprick off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.66,0:24:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们真正的指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know our true orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算违抗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you prepared to disobey?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.80,0:25:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 他想要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. he was gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.26,0:25:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个病态的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, that sick son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.46,0:25:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到他做的这些个事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, did you see what he was doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.76,0:25:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有听到他念了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear him…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.63,0:25:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的咒语总是那么么粗糙\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sloppy his incantation was?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.63,0:25:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兄弟总有那么点傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother always was a little dim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.70,0:26:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让我做最后的祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gonna make me the final sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}His idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.46,0:26:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在这份荣誉归他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, that honor goes to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.66,0:26:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的主人又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our master has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.33,0:26:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份轮班工作需要俩人 你们了解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This spellwork's a two-man job, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.66,0:26:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以600年来 我都和这傲慢的混蛋妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for 600 years, I had to deal with that pompous son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.50,0:26:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划着 准备着 真是忍无可忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planning, preparing … unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.66,0:26:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来 我都想撕下他的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole time, I wanted to rip his face off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.90,0:26:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.13,0:26:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们用枪搞定了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you get him with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.83,0:26:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欢欣雀跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, i love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.80,0:26:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 若在过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, back in the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.65,0:26:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个晚上你该把孩子关在屋内\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was the one night you kept your children inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.96,0:26:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 你们将见识什么才是真正的万圣节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tonight, you'll all see what halloween really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.66,0:27:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.20,0:28:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My love.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.56,0:28:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've aged.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.00,0:28:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This face…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.63,0:28:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.53,0:28:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的美丽早已超越时空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your beauty is beyond time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.40,0:28:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.60,0:29:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到底是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.80,0:29:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,万圣节传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halloween lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.26,0:29:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们过去都是戴着面具来躲避他的 所以我尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}People used to wear masks to hide from him, so I gave it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave it a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎样才能找到那杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna find this mook?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.13,0:30:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是你想在哪复活这些黑暗力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would you go to raise all the dark forces of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.36,0:30:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,公墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.50,0:30:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.10,0:30:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个恶魔法力无边\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this demon's pretty powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.66,0:30:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.00,0:30:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能需要用到不同寻常的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might take more than the usual weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.20,0:30:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.56,0:30:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样都不能用你的魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not using your psychic whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.30,0:30:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But… - Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.66,0:30:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露比的刀就够了 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ruby's knife is enough. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.33,0:30:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使是这么说来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the angel said so, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.83,0:30:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你说过他们是一群宗教狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said they were a bunch of fanatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.63,0:30:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 对于这点他们碰巧说对了 - 我想不通 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, they happen to be right about this. - I don't know, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.63,0:30:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他们对的不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't seem like they're right about much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.10,0:30:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 忘了天使 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, forget the angels, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.30,0:30:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你自己 这些力量 就像玩火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said yourself, these powers … it's like playing with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.53,0:30:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.53,0:31:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我正参加舞会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I'm tripping balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.30,0:31:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静下 是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, shh. be quiet. it's the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.56,0:31:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈丁先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. harding?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.06,0:31:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…don?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.03,0:31:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 你把我们锁里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, don, you, uh … you locked us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.06,0:32:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮帮他们 - 伙计 你不要一个人乱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help them. - Dude, you're not going off alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.76,0:32:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.23,0:32:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back! stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.06,0:32:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.56,0:32:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.36,0:33:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 来吧 恶臭先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it on, stinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.00,0:33:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.46,0:33:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔光线炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}That demon-ray-gun stuff…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.76,0:33:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.46,0:34:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,僵尸与鬼魂的亲密接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zombie-ghost orgy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.96,0:34:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.70,0:34:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去烧了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm torching everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.58,0:36:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天是11月2号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow is november 2nd.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.01,0:36:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的一个纪念日对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an anniversary for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.95,0:36:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.75,0:36:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,22年前的明天亚撒色杀了你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the day azazel killed your mother and, 22 years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.50,0:36:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,22年后杀了你女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your girlfriend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.01,0:36:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难忍受吧 但你却厚着脸皮用了他给你的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be difficult to bear, yet you brazenly use the power he gave you,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.71,0:36:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那亵渎神灵的血液在你的血管里流动着\N{\fnArial\fs30}His profane blood pumping through your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.85,0:36:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.15,0:36:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉过你别再用魔力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were told not to use your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.15,0:36:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.88,0:36:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个恶魔会杀了我和我哥哥以及所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That demon would have killed me and my brother and everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.65,0:36:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉过你别用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were told not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.25,0:36:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果山姆海茵在这个镇被释放 - 现在二次警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If samhain had gotten loose in this town… - Been warned twice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.35,0:36:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我哥哥对你的看法是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my brother was right about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.35,0:36:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真鸡巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.08,0:37:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你存活的唯一理由 萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason you're still alive, sam winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.62,0:37:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你还有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is because you've been useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.35,0:37:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一刻将成为历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment that ceases to be true,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.55,0:37:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一秒你就功不抵过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second you become more trouble then you're worth,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.10,0:37:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再多说一个字 一个字 我就把你变成尘土\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word … one … and I will turn you to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.45,0:37:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.64,0:37:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他该收收他的锐气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him that maybe he should climb off that high horse of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.21,0:37:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.11,0:37:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在地狱的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he remembers from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.65,0:37:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.31,0:37:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿是想说我早告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here for the "i told you so."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.58,0:37:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.31,0:38:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 因为我实在不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good, 'cause I'm really not that interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.78,0:38:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来这儿审判你的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not here to judge you, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.28,0:38:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.78,0:38:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的指示 对 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our orders… - Yeah, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.54,0:38:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了你们的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had about enough of these orders of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.75,0:38:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our orders…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.65,0:38:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是停止召唤山姆海茵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were not to stop the summoning of samhain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.78,0:38:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们依照你对我们的指示来做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were to do whatever you told us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.31,0:38:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的指示来自于我的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your orders were to follow my orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.45,0:38:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a test…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.65,0:38:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你在战争条件下\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see how you would perform under…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.01,0:38:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样表现 你可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battlefield conditions, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.08,0:38:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a witch…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.78,0:38:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是所谓的战争测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the tet offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.11,0:38:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我不合格吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, i, uh, failed your test, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.25,0:38:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.48,0:38:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.38,0:38:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你挥动下魔棒 去除了那段魔法时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were to waive that … that magic time-traveling wand of.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.78,0:39:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就得重新再来遍 我要打同一个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours and we had to do it all over again, I'd make the same call…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.66,0:39:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不知道当这些封印被打破后会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, see, I don't know what's gonna happen when these seals are broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.81,0:39:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 我都不知道明天会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, i don't know what's gonna happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.78,0:39:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道这个地方 这些孩子 这种摇摆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I do know is is that this here … these kids, the swings,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.80,0:39:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些树 所有的这些正因为我弟弟和我才能在这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trees, all of it … is still here because of my brother and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.78,0:39:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误解我了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You misunderstand me, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.45,0:39:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并非你所想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.21,0:39:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷你会选择拯救这个镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was praying that you would choose to save the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.48,0:39:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.01,0:39:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人 他们都是上帝创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people … they're all my father's creations.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.01,0:39:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是艺术品\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're works of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.35,0:39:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.25,0:39:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管你们制止了山姆海茵 封印被打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though you stopped samhain, the seal was broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.77,0:39:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于地球上所有生物而言我们离地狱又近了一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are one step closer to hell on earth for all creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.11,0:39:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是说说而已 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not an expression, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.91,0:39:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's literal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.18,0:39:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们人类应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You of all people should…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.78,0:39:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受这个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.55,0:40:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你一些事你发誓不会告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you something if you promise not to tell another soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.98,0:40:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.91,0:40:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.01,0:40:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个坚定不移的人 就如你所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hammer, as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.21,0:40:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会有疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.45,0:40:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.35,0:40:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有过怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.38,0:40:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道孰对孰错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what is right and what is wrong anymore…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.91,0:40:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也无法判定你是否失败或成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whether you passed or failed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.98,0:40:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在未来的几个月里 你会下定决心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the coming months, you will he more decisions to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.75,0:40:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不羡慕你所担负的重任 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't envy the weight that's on your shoulders, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.71,0:40:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不羡慕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly don't.
